    "R-SQL-2"
  ],
  "description": "Asks, on a writable copy, which constructed values a unique text index (U.K, Text(50), unique index UX_U_K) takes as distinct keys: each INSERT INTO U (ID, K) VALUES (n, <expr>) in order, followed by DBEngine.Errors, for 'a', 'A', 'a ', 'a' & Chr(0), Chr(0), Chr(0) & Chr(0), '', ' ', ChrW(160), 'ss', ChrW(223), ChrW(233), 'e' & ChrW(769), ChrW(65313), ChrW(8203), ChrW(173), ChrW(65279), ChrW(55296), ChrW(56320), a high then a low surrogate, a low then a high surrogate, an astral pair, 'a' & ChrW(65534), 'b', 'b' & Chr(0), 'a' & ChrW(8203), and 50 and 51 characters. Then U is read (ID, K, Len(K), LenB(K)). Fixture r-def-expr-sql-main is opened on a writable fresh copy through DAO.DBEngine.120; engine version and the loaded modules (once) are recorded; each recordset reads Name, Type and Value of every field.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
